    "innovation": "This paper demonstrates through model experiments that the combined, opposing effects of recent Pacific cooling and Indian Ocean warming explain regional Asian monsoon rainfall anomalies, with the dominant Pacific effect suppressing rainfall in East Asia via atmospheric teleconnection.",
